# INVWINIB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: CTRL+E in the
# item form's view mode and CTRL+D at level 1 (READER).  CTRL+E in item
# 1's view mode, whose Edit button is disabled, shows INV's refusal in a
# message box over the form, captioned as the form, where CTRL+E does
# nothing, and whose ENTER leaves the form in view mode; CTRL+D in the
# item list shows the refusal too and duplicates nothing; the end by
# Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINIB.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K CTRL-E
S ONEBOX
K ENTER
S STAYS
K ESC CTRL-D
S NOCOPY
K ENTER
S LIST
K ALT-F X
